    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d539">

                <pb facs="0537" n="527" xml:id="pg527"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.796/658: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caffery</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-12-11T22:00:00-05:00">December 11, 1941—10
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1336. Your 1981, December 10, 11 p.m.<anchor n="77" xml:id="d539-f1"/> This
                    Government is now compelled to regard Lati, which is definitely a military
                    weapon of the Axis, in an entirely different light. The declaration of war
                    against the United States by Japan, Germany and Italy makes it now a matter of
                    vital military necessity to eliminate Lati at once. Please inquire of the
                    Brazilian Government what steps it is taking.</p>
                <p>The regular PAA<anchor n="78" xml:id="d539-f2"/> North Atlantic service to Lisbon
                    may shortly be suspended, and the proposed South Atlantic substitute service to
                    replace Lati would be affected in the same way. However, the Department proposes
                    to seek War and Navy Department approval of a more limited substitute service,
                    say from Natal to a friendly African terminus where junction might be made with
                    an Africa to Great Britain service.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
